WEBVTT

NOTE Why this line has no x-intercept. English captions.

1
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.349
For y equals three, every output is three.

2
00:00:04.899 --> 00:00:07.154
Choose two different input values.

3
00:00:07.804 --> 00:00:11.950
Plot zero, three and another
point with y equal to three.

4
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:15.161
This horizontal line has slope zero.

5
00:00:15.811 --> 00:00:18.747
It crosses the y-axis at zero, three.

6
00:00:19.497 --> 00:00:23.296
It never reaches y equals
zero, so it has no x-intercept.
